// A gift with purchase: the offer's name (jcr:title, an h2), the gift itself, the spend that earns
// it (amount and currency, ISO 4217: each market site sets its own), the conditions, a picture of
// the gift (ctplmix:media) and a call to action (ctplmix:cta). The offer leaves the live site the
// day after its end date; without an end date it stays until an editor removes it.
[ctcm:giftOffer] > jnt:content, mix:title, ctcmmix:pageComponent, ctplmix:sectionStyle, ctplmix:media, ctplmix:cta
 - gift (string, textarea) i18n
 - threshold (double) < '[0,)'
 // cnd-check-ignore(missingI18n): a code among fixed values, labelled in the resource bundles
 - currency (string, choicelist[resourceBundle]) = 'AED' autocreated < 'AED', 'SAR', 'EGP', 'KWD', 'QAR', 'BHD', 'OMR', 'USD', 'EUR', 'GBP'
 - conditions (string, textarea) i18n
 - endsOn (date)
